    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904370/extras/ca40e606971d85f703952ac7025869ee.avif?t=1748813560\" width=500 height=500 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904370/extras/21f3fd9f4de8530721a5621841aae2eb.avif?t=1748813560\" width=450 height=95 /></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Would you sacrifice years of your life to try to save the ones you love?</h2></strong><br><br><strong>Crown Code Chronicles</strong> is a story-driven, JRPG-style game with platformer elements; featuring a unique take on the traditional turn-based system. The game takes place in a magical medieval fantasy world, and journeys back and forth anywhere from prehistoric times all the way to a cyberpunk-style futuristic world.<br><br>Prince Vareus (a.k.a Var) witnesses his father's death, and after a series of events, ends up using an ancient relic to time travel in order to save his father's life. He unknowingly unleashes the greatest threat to existence and must recruit a team of the most powerful fighters throughout time to help defeat that threat, known as Vierus. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904370/extras/b0855a35f7361c790a8e9a8ef0889a41.avif?t=1748813560\" width=450 height=95 /></span><br><br>-Captivating and emotional story that travels through past and future worlds depicting real life themes of loss, love, friendship, and respair<br> <br>-Unique turn-based combat system where players can strategically place and swap characters to different positions in order to use different abilities<br> <br>-No random encounters! Enemies are on-screen so you can avoid non-essential battles using various game mechanics<br> <br>-An all new 3 vs 3 chess-like strategy mini game<br> <br>-Original soundtrack created using sample track by one of the original creators of the game<br> <br>32-bit Pixel Art Graphics",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904370/extras/ca40e606971d85f703952ac7025869ee.avif?t=1748813560\" width=500 height=500 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904370/extras/21f3fd9f4de8530721a5621841aae2eb.avif?t=1748813560\" width=450 height=95 /></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Would you sacrifice years of your life to try to save the ones you love?</h2></strong><br><br><strong>Crown Code Chronicles</strong> is a story-driven, JRPG-style game with platformer elements; featuring a unique take on the traditional turn-based system. The game takes place in a magical medieval fantasy world, and journeys back and forth anywhere from prehistoric times all the way to a cyberpunk-style futuristic world.<br><br>Prince Vareus (a.k.a Var) witnesses his father's death, and after a series of events, ends up using an ancient relic to time travel in order to save his father's life. He unknowingly unleashes the greatest threat to existence and must recruit a team of the most powerful fighters throughout time to help defeat that threat, known as Vierus. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904370/extras/b0855a35f7361c790a8e9a8ef0889a41.avif?t=1748813560\" width=450 height=95 /></span><br><br>-Captivating and emotional story that travels through past and future worlds depicting real life themes of loss, love, friendship, and respair<br> <br>-Unique turn-based combat system where players can strategically place and swap characters to different positions in order to use different abilities<br> <br>-No random encounters! Enemies are on-screen so you can avoid non-essential battles using various game mechanics<br> <br>-An all new 3 vs 3 chess-like strategy mini game<br> <br>-Original soundtrack created using sample track by one of the original creators of the game<br> <br>32-bit Pixel Art Graphics",
    "short_description": "Crown Code Chronicles is a story-driven, JRPG-style game with a unique turn-based combat system. Inspired by titles like Chrono Trigger, Chrono Cross, FFX, &amp; Child Of Light. Experience this emotional roller coaster as Vareus; a prince who uses an ancient relic to time travel to save his loved ones!",
